(7211277, 1111384, 117534, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, I keep coming back to this shot. It really draws me in, makes me want to find that little pub and go there! If this is staged it is perfection, I believe all the faces in this! I don''t know if you are an American but we used to have a show called Cheers, a small bar, where every body knew your name... This should have been the Cheers Theme Shot!</td>', 'This is really nice, I keep coming back to this shot. It really draws me in, makes me want to find that little pub and go there! If this is staged it is perfection, I believe all the faces in this! I don''t know if you are an American but we used to have a show called Cheers, a small bar, where every body knew your name... This should have been the Cheers Theme Shot!', '2014-05-02 12:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
