(7211502, 1111489, 86447, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like partial desats...<br/> <br/>This time is no exception.<br/> <br/>I like the pensiveness of her eyes.<br/> <br/>Her mouth is saying "skepticism" or "slight disgust" to me.<br/> <br/>I don''t see beauty here.  I''m sorry... *eek*<br/> <br/>But... it''s what I see.  <br/> <br/>SHE is beautiful... but that''s not what your image, or the challenge topic says.<br/> <br/> <br/>6</td>', 'I don''t usually like partial desats... This time is no exception. I like the pensiveness of her eyes. Her mouth is saying "skepticism" or "slight disgust" to me. I don''t see beauty here.  I''m sorry... *eek* But... it''s what I see.   SHE is beautiful... but that''s not what your image, or the challenge topic says.  6', '2014-05-02 23:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211503, 1110837, 86447, '<td valign="top">The lack of emotion here does not lead me to say "beautiful" when I describe this image.<br/> <br/>It''s a good image... It just doesn''t say "beautiful" to me.<br/> <br/>If I were to describe it (which is how I judge whether my entry fits the current challenge), I''d include "fake", "cold", "stern"...<br/> <br/>But, I wouldn''t come up with "beauty" if I didn''t already know the challenge.<br/> <br/>I hate to say it, but I''d want you to say it to me.   Really.   5</td>', 'The lack of emotion here does not lead me to say "beautiful" when I describe this image. It''s a good image... It just doesn''t say "beautiful" to me. If I were to describe it (which is how I judge whether my entry fits the current challenge), I''d include "fake", "cold", "stern"... But, I wouldn''t come up with "beauty" if I didn''t already know the challenge. I hate to say it, but I''d want you to say it to me.   Really.   5', '2014-05-02 23:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
