(7211506, 1111525, 86447, '<td valign="top">Is that a crashed airplane?<br/> <br/>Or what?<br/> <br/>If I were to describe it... without knowing the challenge topic  (which is how I like to determine if my entry fits the challenge topic), I''d describe it as "death with a beautiful sky".<br/> <br/>Great composition.   But... to me... it doesn''t say "beauty".   5</td>', 'Is that a crashed airplane? Or what? If I were to describe it... without knowing the challenge topic  (which is how I like to determine if my entry fits the challenge topic), I''d describe it as "death with a beautiful sky". Great composition.   But... to me... it doesn''t say "beauty".   5', '2014-05-02 23:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211507, 1111595, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!   I thought of doing the same thing.  And then I remembered my requirement of myself in challenges like this.<br/> <br/>I ask myself to describe my image.  In words.   <br/> <br/>If my word isn''t clearly one of the challenge topic words... well... I score poorly.<br/> <br/>If you asked me to describe this image, not knowing the challenge topic, I''d say "a caricature of a handsome man."<br/> <br/>"Beauty" would not enter it ... even if someone asked me if this were beautiful. <br/> <br/>I''m sorry... I just say what I want others to say about my images... and... they never are brave enough to answer to their vote when they think I''ve not hit the mark.   A 5 from me.<br/> <br/>You''re really cute.   But... not beautiful here.  :D</td>', 'Ha!   I thought of doing the same thing.  And then I remembered my requirement of myself in challenges like this. I ask myself to describe my image.  In words.    If my word isn''t clearly one of the challenge topic words... well... I score poorly. If you asked me to describe this image, not knowing the challenge topic, I''d say "a caricature of a handsome man." "Beauty" would not enter it ... even if someone asked me if this were beautiful.  I''m sorry... I just say what I want others to say about my images... and... they never are brave enough to answer to their vote when they think I''ve not hit the mark.   A 5 from me. You''re really cute.   But... not beautiful here.  :D', '2014-05-02 23:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
