(7211537, 1111539, 86447, '<td valign="top">Not loving your title.  It limits beauty to only racial unity.  But that''s not what''s being voted on here anyway. (I HATE having to have titles!)<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful image.  <br/> <br/> <br/>Unity of any kind is beautiful.  <br/> <br/>The shadows are not.<br/> <br/>The tones are.<br/> <br/>7 from me.</td>', 'Not loving your title.  It limits beauty to only racial unity.  But that''s not what''s being voted on here anyway. (I HATE having to have titles!) It''s a beautiful image.    Unity of any kind is beautiful.   The shadows are not. The tones are. 7 from me.', '2014-05-02 23:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
