(7211703, 1111074, 24983, '<td valign="top">difficult exposure problem here not cure if you used an ND filter.but the water is too overexposed for my liking which will make me unpopular with you.<br/> <br/>To be honest I would 1/2 the height and use the rockery as the focal point.</td>', 'difficult exposure problem here not cure if you used an ND filter.but the water is too overexposed for my liking which will make me unpopular with you. To be honest I would 1/2 the height and use the rockery as the focal point.', '2014-05-03 01:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
