(7211706, 1110967, 96751, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing image. Is that really her hair, or was that added?  The style of this image reminds me of several DPCers, but it''s a splendid capture. I''m wondering if the smoke is from a brush fire...</td>', 'Mesmerizing image. Is that really her hair, or was that added?  The style of this image reminds me of several DPCers, but it''s a splendid capture. I''m wondering if the smoke is from a brush fire...', '2014-05-03 01:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
