(7211713, 1110870, 24983, '<td valign="top">Think you have overdone the PP.<br/>Ps has its place and uses as well.<br/> <br/>I viewed some images of the West Coast of N.Z the other day and believe me I have never ever seen the west coast like it they had been PS to Hell and bore no resemblance to the "Coast" at all.</td>', 'Think you have overdone the PP.Ps has its place and uses as well. I viewed some images of the West Coast of N.Z the other day and believe me I have never ever seen the west coast like it they had been PS to Hell and bore no resemblance to the "Coast" at all.', '2014-05-03 01:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
