(7211747, 1110837, 174999, '<td valign="top">WOW!! Looked at this for a while, colors in this, composition and background are amazing.. just wish I knew how to critique things better! Nice job</td>', 'WOW!! Looked at this for a while, colors in this, composition and background are amazing.. just wish I knew how to critique things better! Nice job', '2014-05-03 09:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211749, 1111522, 114285, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm very interesting take on the challenge, seems a little odd in here, but everyone sees beauty differently, what is ugly to some, is lovely to another.<br/> <br/>Having said that I can see why you like the simplicity of this image, if it was mine though, I would of cropped the top  off as  it doesn''t  add to the image  at all, I like the high contrast look though.</td>', 'Hmmmm very interesting take on the challenge, seems a little odd in here, but everyone sees beauty differently, what is ugly to some, is lovely to another. Having said that I can see why you like the simplicity of this image, if it was mine though, I would of cropped the top  off as  it doesn''t  add to the image  at all, I like the high contrast look though.', '2014-05-03 09:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211751, 1111175, 114285, '<td valign="top">Interesting!</td>', 'Interesting!', '2014-05-03 10:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211799, 1111384, 140305, '<td valign="top">The two empty chairs.....I want to be in one of them hearing that song! This is an amazing, compelling photo, full of delight and most definitely embodies the spirit of beauty. If this is not on the front page I will be amazed. It''s a 10 from me.</td>', 'The two empty chairs.....I want to be in one of them hearing that song! This is an amazing, compelling photo, full of delight and most definitely embodies the spirit of beauty. If this is not on the front page I will be amazed. It''s a 10 from me.', '2014-05-03 12:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211806, 1111539, 96751, '<td valign="top">Classic image, softly rendered</td>', 'Classic image, softly rendered', '2014-05-03 12:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211808, 1111541, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous pooch. Looks like she''s chomping down on a Christmas ornament!!  I like the angle and the light, but feel that his is one of those images that would benefit from a lot of fine detail, either throughout - encompassing the mane - or just on the face, and with a gentle vignetting or even closer crop to fill the frame. It feels a little soft and "general" to me</td>', 'Gorgeous pooch. Looks like she''s chomping down on a Christmas ornament!!  I like the angle and the light, but feel that his is one of those images that would benefit from a lot of fine detail, either throughout - encompassing the mane - or just on the face, and with a gentle vignetting or even closer crop to fill the frame. It feels a little soft and "general" to me', '2014-05-03 12:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211821, 1111532, 96751, '<td valign="top">A beautiful creation, Christophe. I love everything about this - the muted colors and tones, the spectacular light,the water "surface" where we wouldn''t expect it. I''m a bit puzzled about the belly at lower left, but I suppose it is a "meta" belly, giving birth to all life. <br/> <br/>As someone who has been stung by jellyfish, I''m a bit freaked out about them being so close to her, but their color and transparency is delightful. And either congratulations are in order, or that is a very nicely ''shopped pregnancy ;)</td>', 'A beautiful creation, Christophe. I love everything about this - the muted colors and tones, the spectacular light,the water "surface" where we wouldn''t expect it. I''m a bit puzzled about the belly at lower left, but I suppose it is a "meta" belly, giving birth to all life.  As someone who has been stung by jellyfish, I''m a bit freaked out about them being so close to her, but their color and transparency is delightful. And either congratulations are in order, or that is a very nicely ''shopped pregnancy ;)', '2014-05-03 13:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211822, 1111500, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah, this so reminds me of mornings on my way to work</td>', 'Ah, this so reminds me of mornings on my way to work', '2014-05-03 13:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211825, 1111517, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such gorgeous eyes! I''m not sure about the crop, including the pink area on the right. I keep going over there, expecting something. Maybe cropped in to the hair...?</td>', 'Such gorgeous eyes! I''m not sure about the crop, including the pink area on the right. I keep going over there, expecting something. Maybe cropped in to the hair...?', '2014-05-03 13:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
