(7211827, 1111515, 96751, '<td valign="top">The back of his jacket is a tenuous connection to the challenge. This is such a powerful image, with such dynamic energy, and such a strong connection between two people unaware of each other. The diagonal line cutting through both of them emphasizes their opposing journeys, filled with such purposeful strides. I''m afraid it is not going to get the love it deserves in this challenge.</td>', 'The back of his jacket is a tenuous connection to the challenge. This is such a powerful image, with such dynamic energy, and such a strong connection between two people unaware of each other. The diagonal line cutting through both of them emphasizes their opposing journeys, filled with such purposeful strides. I''m afraid it is not going to get the love it deserves in this challenge.', '2014-05-03 13:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211828, 1110881, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Perfectly lit</td>', 'Lovely. Perfectly lit', '2014-05-03 13:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7211829, 1111595, 96751, '<td valign="top">You manic genius :)  Looks like you''ve lost a lot of weight....</td>', 'You manic genius :)  Looks like you''ve lost a lot of weight....', '2014-05-03 13:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
