(7212386, 1110586, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment<br/> <br/>Wow what a way to show off the beauty of nature!!! Must have been an amazing sight to see and watch these impala''s (I think) out in the bush. Great capture, I think you could crop it even closer to get your audience even closer to the natural beauty of these animals. Nicely captured!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment Wow what a way to show off the beauty of nature!!! Must have been an amazing sight to see and watch these impala''s (I think) out in the bush. Great capture, I think you could crop it even closer to get your audience even closer to the natural beauty of these animals. Nicely captured!', '2014-05-04 22:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212388, 1110682, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Excellent capture of these birds taking flight! Love the blue green hues off of the wings - shame you couldn''t capture a much closer view, but you did get the whole crew! Maybe I read too much into the imagery, but I see the fence in the backdrop as a pertinent part of the scene symbolically. Just as the are escaping the bounds of the earth as they take flight, so to, do they rise above the fences that man erects(as they are doing here). Nature wild and free.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Excellent capture of these birds taking flight! Love the blue green hues off of the wings - shame you couldn''t capture a much closer view, but you did get the whole crew! Maybe I read too much into the imagery, but I see the fence in the backdrop as a pertinent part of the scene symbolically. Just as the are escaping the bounds of the earth as they take flight, so to, do they rise above the fences that man erects(as they are doing here). Nature wild and free.', '2014-05-04 22:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7212390, 1111552, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Gorgeous soft and delicate blues! Love the details seen in this floral shot. And the title is very fitting:-) It is indeed - bluetiful!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Gorgeous soft and delicate blues! Love the details seen in this floral shot. And the title is very fitting:-) It is indeed - bluetiful!', '2014-05-04 22:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
