(7216969, 1111261, 119012, '<td valign="top">i think the skin is far too soft for a man. and there is way too much negative space behind the subject. A better tighter crop would have done wonders. i do like the light position and shadows, but i''d like to see more texture, especially in the facial hair.<br/> <br/>i do see your intent here but this face doesn''t say beauty to me, that not to say males cant be the face of beauty but if you choose a male subject think you''d be better served focusing on physique and form over a portrait.</td>', 'i think the skin is far too soft for a man. and there is way too much negative space behind the subject. A better tighter crop would have done wonders. i do like the light position and shadows, but i''d like to see more texture, especially in the facial hair. i do see your intent here but this face doesn''t say beauty to me, that not to say males cant be the face of beauty but if you choose a male subject think you''d be better served focusing on physique and form over a portrait.', '2014-05-15 10:05:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7216972, 1111552, 119012, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting image, i think its too dark for its own good. the negative spaces i''d like to see lighter. When i think of beauty, black isnt the first color that comes to mind.<br/> <br/>it just feel too cold, maybe if it was warmer i''d feel differently about it.</td>', 'this is an interesting image, i think its too dark for its own good. the negative spaces i''d like to see lighter. When i think of beauty, black isnt the first color that comes to mind. it just feel too cold, maybe if it was warmer i''d feel differently about it.', '2014-05-15 10:08:19.000000', NULL, 0),
